{"id":"9bf229cbde42433e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/606_条件义务逻辑.md","title":"606 条件义务逻辑","display":"606_条件义务逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{cobl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{cobl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cobl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cobl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)=\\operatorname{cobl}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O(A\\mid B)=\\operatorname{cobl}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无条件义务是派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"OA=O(A\\mid\\top),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[OA=O(A\\mid\\top),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其他派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span> 是满足以下条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换、相等\">3. 自由变元、替换、相等</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{606}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{606}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(O(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(O(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{606}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{606}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{606}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{606}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{606}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{606}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{606}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(O(A\\mid B))=O(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\mid\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(O(A\\mid B))=O(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\mid\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{606}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{606}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{606}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,606}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{606}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,606}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{606}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{606}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{606}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{606}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{606}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{606}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件义务正规性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_K}^{606}\n=\n\\{O(A\\to B\\mid C)\\to(O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_K}^{606}\n=\n\\{O(A\\to B\\mid C)\\to(O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件义务一致性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_D}^{606}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg O(\\neg A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_D}^{606}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg O(\\neg A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件脱离公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Detach}^{606}\n=\n\\{B\\to(O(A\\mid B)\\to OA):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Detach}^{606}\n=\n\\{B\\to(O(A\\mid B)\\to OA):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件合取公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CAnd}^{606}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid C)\\to(O(B\\mid C)\\to O(A\\land B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CAnd}^{606}\n=\n\\{O(A\\mid C)\\to(O(B\\mid C)\\to O(A\\land B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{606}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_K}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_D}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Detach}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CAnd}^{606}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{606}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_K}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CO_D}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Detach}^{606}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CAnd}^{606}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{606}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{606}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件义务后件规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{CO}^{606}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B),\\,O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{CO}^{606}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B),\\,O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件等价规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{606}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),\\,O(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O(A\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{606}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),\\,O(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O(A\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{606}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{606}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{CO}^{606}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{606}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{606}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{606}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{CO}^{606}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{606}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{606}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{606}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\)</span>。每行理由如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{606}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{606}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\to B\">\\(A_j=A\\to B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)\">\\(A_i=O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=O(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O(A\\mid C)\">\\(A_i=O(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O(A\\mid C)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{606}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{606}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{606}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{606}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-语义结构与满足\">8. 语义结构与满足</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"606\">\\(606\\)</span>-条件义务选择模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{COMod}_{606}\">\\(\\mathsf{COMod}_{606}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}:\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}:\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\subseteq X\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\subseteq X\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(X\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\to B⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\to B⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ O(A\\mid B)⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{Best}(⟦ B⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ O(A\\mid B)⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{Best}(⟦ B⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{606}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{606}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{606}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{606}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best})\\in\\mathsf{COMod}_{606}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{606}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{606}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{606}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best})\\in\\mathsf{COMod}_{606}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{606}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{606}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目把义务直接做成二元构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\)</span>，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Detach}^{606}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Detach}^{606}\\)</span> 固定从条件事实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 到无条件义务 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\">\\(OA\\)</span> 的句法脱离。它不是 Åqvist <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的条件传递，也不是单纯 CK 条件逻辑。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-定理集合\">10. 定理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{606}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{606}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{606}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{606}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{606}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CO}_{606}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{606},\\operatorname{FV}_{606},\\operatorname{BV}_{606},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{606},\\operatorname{Sub}_{606},\\equiv_{\\alpha,606},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{606},\\mathsf{Rule}_{606},\\mathsf{Proof}_{606},\\vdash_{606},\\mathsf{Thm}_{606},\n\\mathsf{COMod}_{606},⟦-⟧_{606},\\Vdash_{606},\\models_{606}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CO}_{606}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{606},\\operatorname{FV}_{606},\\operatorname{BV}_{606},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{606},\\operatorname{Sub}_{606},\\equiv_{\\alpha,606},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{606},\\mathsf{Rule}_{606},\\mathsf{Proof}_{606},\\vdash_{606},\\mathsf{Thm}_{606},\n\\mathsf{COMod}_{606},⟦-⟧_{606},\\Vdash_{606},\\models_{606}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含条件义务公式、句法替换、公理、证明关系、选择函数义务语义与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换、相等","text":"3. 自由变元、替换、相等","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象"